{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34401","headline":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 一 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美怀华阳润卿博士三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几降真官授隐书，洛公曾到梦中无。\n眉间入静三辰影，肘後通灵五岳图。\n北洞树形如曲盖，东凹山色入薰炉。\n金墟福地能容否，愿作冈前蒋负刍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}